{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>The first of the first fruits.</b> It needed to say it here because above it did not specify 'land' — [the land] of the seven nations — whereas here it specified it." "<b>You shall not cook a kid in its mother's milk.</b> Do not leave it until its growth is completed in its mother's milk, but at the beginning of its growth you shall bring it. A parallel: ראשית בכורי אדמתך תביא וגו׳ — from the moment it begins to ripen you shall bring it, and not delay until the completion of the fruits. בישול (cooking) is an expression of completion, like הבשילו אשכלותיה ענבים."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:53.371645483Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}